<title>USA: Loews Corp Q3 net shr rises to $3.37.</title>
<headline>Loews Corp Q3 net shr rises to $3.37.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.37		    $3.28</p>
<p> Net			388,600		  386,400</p>
<p> Revs		   5,216,300		4,959,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 115,200		  117,800</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			  $9.75		    $8.66</p>
<p> Net		    1,136,100		1,020,600</p>
<p> Revs		  15,305,400	     13,182,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 116,500		  117,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call earnings estimate for 1996 Q3 is $2.30 per share.</p>
<p>1995 nine months includes results of Continental Corp on the basis of purchase value accounting from May 10, 1995, the effective date of acquisition.</p>
<p>The company purchased 2.8 million of its shares during the first nine months of 1996.</p>
